// The whole config. Everything else has a default: content lives in `content`,
// templates in `templates`, the build lands in `public`, and links resolve
// relative to the `url` below.
//
// Nothing is generated that you did not ask for, so there is no feed, no
// sitemap, no robots.txt and no taxonomy here. Add a `generate { }` block when
// you want them.

site "{{site}}"
url "{{url}}"
author "{{author}}"
lang "en"
